launcher-index.bin.gz is generated from Unicode CLDR annotation and emoji-test
data, and from the FontVibe kaomoji-dataset core set.

emoji data: Unicode CLDR annotations, emoji-test.txt
languages: en, de, es, pt, ja, zh, fr, it, ko, ru, nl, pl, tr, id, vi

